    "description": {
      "content": "The Bluebeam Studio API enables programmatic access to Studio Sessions for document collaboration, markup management, and PDF review workflows. OAuth 2.0 REST APIs allow third-party applications to create and manage studio sessions, retrieve markup data, and integrate document annotations into AEC construction workflows.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Bluebeam Developer Portal",
